    <title>lmi内核刷入问题</title>
    <link href="http://example.com/2026/05/25/lmi%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%88%B7%E5%85%A5%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/"/>
    <id>http://example.com/2026/05/25/lmi%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%88%B7%E5%85%A5%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/</id>
    <published>2026-05-25T11:16:48.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-05-25T11:17:10.864Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>报错为<code>Magisk detected! Patching kernel so reflashing Magisk is not necessary... 刷写失败</code></p><p>原因是在注入Magisk环境变量时通过<code>export $(cat .magisk)</code>直接导出文件内容作为shell变量。但是由于<code>.magisk</code>文件中包含了非法格式的变量名,shell报错并强制中止脚本导致刷写失败。</p><p>##解决方式<br>将原<code>ak3-core.sh</code>脚本中的:</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[ ! -f .magisk ] &amp;&amp; magiskboot cpio ramdisk.cpio &quot;extract .backup/.magisk .magisk&quot;;</span><br><span class="line">export $(cat .magisk);</span><br><span class="line">for fdt in dtb extra kernel_dtb recovery_dtbo; do</span><br><span class="line">  [ -f $fdt ] &amp;&amp; magiskboot dtb $fdt patch; </span><br><span class="line">  # remove dtb verity/avb</span><br><span class="line">done;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>修改为</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[ ! -f .magisk ] &amp;&amp; magiskboot cpio ramdisk.cpio &quot;extract .backup/.magisk .magisk&quot;;</span><br><span class="line">[ -f .magisk ] &amp;&amp; while IFS=&#x27;=&#x27; read key value; do</span><br><span class="line">  case $key in</span><br><span class="line">    [A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*)</span><br><span class="line">      export $key=&quot;$value&quot;</span><br><span class="line">    ;;</span><br><span class="line">  esac;</span><br><span class="line">done &lt; .magisk;</span><br><span class="line">for fdt in dtb extra kernel_dtb recovery_dtbo; do</span><br><span class="line">  [ -f $fdt ] &amp;&amp; magiskboot dtb $fdt patch;</span><br><span class="line">done;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>设备为lmi，底包LineageOS23.2，刷入AviumUI_GSI 16.2.1</p></blockquote>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
    <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;报错为&lt;code&gt;Magisk detected! Patching kernel so reflashing Magisk is not necessary... 刷写失败&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原因是在注入Magisk环境变量时通过&lt;code&gt;export $(c</summary>
      
    
    
    
    
